{"status": "held", "mode": "saved_replay", "automated_readiness": false, "source_digest": "ba891ac312a2086875f5dcbf71ac31b7e88afb8b43989890f6406feb1faebcd8", "started_at": "2026-09-23T20:32:20.213024+00:00", "package": {"title": "\u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643: \u0645\u0646 \u0637\u0644\u0628 \u0645\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0628 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a 35 \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629", "cards": [{"kind": "info", "title": "\u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643\u2026 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u062c\u0627\u064a \u0645\u0646 \u0632\u0639\u064a\u0645 \u0642\u0628\u064a\u0644\u0629", "body": "\u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0648\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0627\u062d\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0637\u0646\u064a \u0634\u0645\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636\u060c \u0634\u0627\u0631\u0643\u062a \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0627\u062a \u00ab\u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643\u00bb \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u062d\u0631\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0637\u0646\u064a. \u0648\u0647\u064a \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0633\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u062a\u0639\u062f\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0627\u0645 \u0628\u0631\u0623\u0633 \u062f\u0648\u0651\u0627\u0631 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0631\u0628\u0639 \u0634\u0641\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0648\u0645\u062d\u0631\u0643\u064a\u0646\u060c \u0645\u0646 \u062a\u0635\u0646\u064a\u0639 \u0634\u0631\u0643\u0629 \u0633\u064a\u0643\u0648\u0631\u0633\u0643\u064a. \u0623\u0645\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0641\u0645\u0623\u062e\u0648\u0630 \u0645\u0646 \u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643\u060c \u0632\u0639\u064a\u0645 \u0642\u0628\u064a\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0648\u0643.", "punch": "\u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0634\u0647\u0631\u0629\u060c \u0643\u0627\u0646\u062a \u0645\u062c\u0631\u062f \u0645\u062a\u0637\u0644\u0628\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0628\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0648\u0631\u0642.", "claim_ids": ["c1", "c7"], "image_query": "Black Hawk helicopter", "image": {"provider": "flickr", "asset_id": "flickr:54032051645", "title": "United States Army Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk Helicopter - Laramie - Wyoming", "description": "A U.S. Army Black Hawk helicopter at the University of Wyoming campus in Laramie, Wyoming, on March 6, 2024.", "source_url": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/diversey/54032051645/", "download_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54032051645_90f2d16b95_b.jpg", "original_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54032051645_ea0ff09c18_o.jpg", "width": 1024, "height": 686, "credit": "Tony Webster", "credit_line": "", "copyright_notice": "", "rights_links": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/diversey", "license": "CC BY 2.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "restrictions": "", "attribution_required": "true", "source_verified": true, "licensing_verified": false, "date_created": "", "image_role": "subject illustration; event date unverified", "sha256": "a405387932d4e38cb1d51a51f84b6f1cdcf2a55d5752a3370e2daec57bfc13c9", "origin_key": "flickr:54032051645", "pixel_description": "Dark green UH-60 Black Hawk helicopter in flight against blue sky, evergreen trees visible below"}, "public_attribution": {"version": 3, "display_label": "Tony Webster", "image_sha256": "1d63b71fb11431e7b2e790b20d15ab60b2d26e5fb2bacae434ca025e1174511a", "media_sha256": "9c7e5dc657b64994f7538b5adf2c34902d8d76004e8fde7fa38e67b0242186d7"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0627\u0644\u0628\u062f\u0627\u064a\u0629: \u064a\u0628\u0648\u0646 \u0628\u062f\u064a\u0644 \u0644\u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u062f\u064a\u0645\u0629", "body": "\u0641\u064a \u0623\u0648\u0627\u062e\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u062a\u064a\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u064a\u0634 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0631\u064a\u0643\u064a \u064a\u0643\u062a\u0628 \u0645\u062a\u0637\u0644\u0628\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u062a\u062d\u0644 \u0645\u062d\u0644 \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 UH-1 \u0625\u064a\u0631\u0648\u0643\u0648\u0627. \u0648\u0628\u0646\u0627\u0621\u064b \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u062a\u062c\u0631\u0628\u062a\u0647\u0645 \u0641\u064a \u0641\u064a\u062a\u0646\u0627\u0645\u060c \u0637\u0644\u0628\u0648\u0627 \u062a\u062d\u0633\u064a\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0643\u0628\u064a\u0631\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0627\u0621 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0642\u062f\u0631\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u062c\u0627\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0627\u0639\u062a\u0645\u0627\u062f\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0639\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0643 \u062a\u0648\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0646\u064a \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f \u064a\u062a\u0637\u0648\u0631 \u062e\u0635\u064a\u0635\u0627\u064b \u0644\u0647\u0630\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0627\u062a.", "punch": "\u0627\u0644\u0637\u0644\u0628 \u062a\u062d\u0648\u0651\u0644 \u0644\u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c \u062d\u0642\u064a\u0642\u064a\u0629 \u062a\u0637\u064a\u0631 \u0648\u062a\u0646\u062e\u062a\u0628\u0631.", "claim_ids": ["c2", "c3"], "image_query": "Black Hawk helicopter", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "116608", "title": "File:Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk dimensions.png", "original_width": 1642, "original_height": 626, "description": "Line drawing showing the dimensions of the UH-60 Black Hawk helicopter. I modified it in GIMP .", "download_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/Sikorsky_UH-60_Black_Hawk_dimensions.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/Sikorsky_UH-60_Black_Hawk_dimensions.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sikorsky_UH-60_Black_Hawk_dimensions.png", "credit": "U.S. Army via en:User:Casito", "credit_line": "U.S. Army Technical Manual TM 1-1520-237-10 (Operator's Manual for UH-60A Helicopter, UH-60L Helicopter, EH-60A Helicopter)", "rights_links": "", "copyright_notice": "", "attribution_notice": "", "usage_terms": "Public domain", "disclaimer": "", "license": "Public domain", "license_url": "", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "", "width": 1642, "height": 626, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "44f1e4fbde76e7b244fba1de5648d3e065d4c14cc178d8f14d44c49b23f472ce", "origin_key": "116608", "image_role": "subject illustration; event date requires review"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0623\u0631\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c \u0648\u0645\u0646\u0627\u0641\u0633\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0642\u062f", "body": "\u0628\u064f\u0646\u064a\u062a \u0623\u0631\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c \u0623\u0648\u0644\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u0648\u062d\u062f\u0629 \u0645\u0646\u0647\u0627 \u0637\u0627\u0631\u062a \u0641\u064a 17 \u0623\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0628\u0631 1974. \u0648\u0628\u0639\u062f \u0645\u0627 \u0642\u0627\u0631\u0646\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u064a\u0634 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0631\u064a\u0643\u064a \u0628\u062a\u0635\u0645\u064a\u0645 \u0645\u0646\u0627\u0641\u0633 \u0645\u0646 \u0634\u0631\u0643\u0629 \u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0627\u062e\u062a\u0627\u0631 \u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643 \u0644\u0644\u0625\u0646\u062a\u0627\u062c \u0641\u064a \u062f\u064a\u0633\u0645\u0628\u0631 1976.", "punch": "\u0648\u0647\u0646\u0627 \u0628\u062f\u0623 \u062e\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0633\u0644\u064a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0639\u0644\u064a.", "claim_ids": ["c4", "c5"], "image_query": "Black Hawk helicopter", "image": {"provider": "flickr", "asset_id": "flickr:3880731404", "title": "Radom Air Show 2009 #50", "description": "Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk", "source_url": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/szift/3880731404/", "download_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/2637/3880731404_9bcefe34d7_b.jpg", "original_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/2637/3880731404_081bb9fd8d_o.jpg", "width": 1024, "height": 685, "credit": "\u0141ukasz Hejnak", "credit_line": "", "copyright_notice": "", "rights_links": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/szift", "license": "CC BY 2.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "restrictions": "", "attribution_required": "true", "source_verified": true, "licensing_verified": false, "date_created": "", "image_role": "subject illustration; event date unverified", "sha256": "a4e4f6e7e0ada529727616b767c3ef7af96109165a4a1b8568f6a611fa5aab82", "origin_key": "flickr:3880731404", "pixel_description": "UH-60 Black Hawk helicopter parked on tarmac at air show, front view, crowd of spectators behind barriers, tent visible"}, "public_attribution": {"version": 3, "display_label": "\u0141ukasz Hejnak", "image_sha256": "d7eee1d9947b54b392274284f6a6d81b40ab42f29b9ba3f1b03ebab399f79ff2", "media_sha256": "82e986304674dc07188d449d609d1fcd119cf7de1590c8c191bda8a31dfe18ba"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0648\u064a\u0646 \u0648\u0635\u0644\u062a\u061f \u0641\u064a \u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 35 \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629", "body": "\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u062a\u0633\u0644\u064a\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u062c\u064a\u0634 \u0641\u064a \u0623\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0628\u0631 1978\u060c \u0648\u062f\u062e\u0644\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u064a\u0648\u0646\u064a\u0648 1979 \u0644\u062a\u062d\u0644 \u0641\u0639\u0644\u0627\u064b \u0645\u062d\u0644 UH-1 \u0625\u064a\u0631\u0648\u0643\u0648\u0627 \u0643\u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0646\u0642\u0644 \u062a\u0643\u062a\u064a\u0643\u064a. \u0648\u0645\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0642\u062a \u0627\u0646\u062a\u0634\u0631\u062a \u062e\u0627\u0631\u062c \u0628\u0644\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0634\u0623\u060c \u062d\u062a\u0649 \u0635\u0627\u0631\u062a \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0644\u062f\u0649 35 \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u062d\u062a\u0649 \u0639\u0627\u0645 2024.", "punch": "\u0648\u0645\u0646\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064a \u062a\u0634\u0648\u0641\u0647 \u0641\u064a \u0633\u0645\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636 \u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u062d\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0644.", "claim_ids": ["c6", "c7", "c8"], "image_query": "Black Hawk helicopter", "image_caption": "\u0635\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u062a\u0648\u0636\u064a\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0644\u0627\u0643 \u0647\u0648\u0643", "image": {"provider": "flickr", "asset_id": "flickr:40982235134", "title": "US Army UH-60 Black Hawk", "description": "United States Army Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk 20823 flyby over Riga Airport", "source_url": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/101181388@N07/40982235134/", "download_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/864/40982235134_de1a57ed6b_b.jpg", "original_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/864/40982235134_ed68e3d67f_o.jpg", "width": 1024, "height": 683, "credit": "Jevgenijs Slihto", "credit_line": "", "copyright_notice": "", "rights_links": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/101181388@N07", "license": "CC BY 2.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "restrictions": "", "attribution_required": "true", "source_verified": true, "licensing_verified": false, "date_created": "", "image_role": "subject illustration; event date unverified", "sha256": "005f70829d089e4a4e77f402881bdcc162c8861c5eee644b75243ac079343fa4", "origin_key": "flickr:40982235134", "pixel_description": "UH-60 Black Hawk helicopter in flight, side view, 'UNITED STATES ARMY' text on tail boom, blue sky background"}, "public_attribution": {"version": 3, "display_label": "Jevgenijs Slihto", "image_sha256": "e9b218acfa4e53d7906ab1b6715b91a9ed29015aeb85e132467b28d7a6df3282", "media_sha256": "38ab87f5c6dfe40139130d97dad0f8b15d69d7cc8d86da1277f2fedf00c86701"}}, {"kind": "credits", "title": "\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0635\u0627\u062f\u0631 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0635\u0648\u0631", "body": "Editorial sources and photo attribution", "image": {"provider": "flickr", "asset_id": "flickr:54032051645", "title": "United States Army Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk Helicopter - Laramie - Wyoming", "description": "A U.S. Army Black Hawk helicopter at the University of Wyoming campus in Laramie, Wyoming, on March 6, 2024.", "source_url": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/diversey/54032051645/", "download_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54032051645_90f2d16b95_b.jpg", "original_url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54032051645_ea0ff09c18_o.jpg", "width": 1024, "height": 686, "credit": "Tony Webster", "credit_line": "", "copyright_notice": "", "rights_links": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/diversey", "license": "CC BY 2.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "restrictions": "", "attribution_required": "true", "source_verified": true, "licensing_verified": false, "date_created": "", "image_role": "subject illustration; event date unverified", "sha256": "a405387932d4e38cb1d51a51f84b6f1cdcf2a55d5752a3370e2daec57bfc13c9", "origin_key": "flickr:54032051645", "pixel_description": "Dark green UH-60 Black Hawk helicopter in flight against blue sky, evergreen trees visible below"}}], "sources": [{"id": "article", "url": "https://www.alyaum.com/articles/6683976/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%AE%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%B1/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%85%D9%84%D9%83%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%85/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B6-%D8%AA%D8%AD%D8%AA%D9%81%D9%84-%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B7%D9%86%D9%8A-%D8%A8%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%B6-%D8%B9%D8%B3%D9%83%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D9%88%D9%85%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A7%D8%AA-%D8%AC%D9%88%D9%8A%D8%A9", "text": "\u062c\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0628\u062f\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0627\u0631\u064a - \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636 2026/09/23 20:30 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u062a\u0645\u062a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0631\u0628\u0639\u0627\u0621 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0631\u0643\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0631\u0636 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0624\u062a\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0628\u0645\u0644\u0647\u0645\u060c (\u0634\u0645\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0635\u0645\u0629)\u060c \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0648\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0633\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0635\u0627\u062d\u0628\u0629", "retrieved_text_sha256": "965802c58f0cecb1e1c33e6086d850998bb8ea1c49f520d8e4a072b62c4d5796"}, {"id": "wiki-37941", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/?curid=37941", "text": "The Sikorsky UH-60 Black Hawk is a four-blade, twin-engine, medium-lift military utility helicopter manufactured by Sikorsky Aircraft. Sikorsky submitted a design for\n===\nIn the late 1960s, the United States Army began forming requirements for a helicopter to replace the UH-1 Iroquois, and designated\nfor its helicopters that would become the General Electric T700. Based on experience in Vietnam, the Army required significant performance, survivability and\ncrashworthy fuel system.\nFour prototypes were constructed, with the first YUH-60A flying on 17 October 1974. Prior to the delivery of the\nYUH-61A, and one was kept by Sikorsky for internal research. The Army selected the UH-60 for production in December 1976. Deliveries of\nthe UH-60A to the Army began in October 1978 and the helicopter entered service in June 1979.\n\n\n=== Upgrades and variations ===\nafter the Sauk leader Black Hawk, the UH-60A entered service with the U.S. Army in 1979, to replace the Bell UH-1 Iroquois\nhistory ==\nThe UH-60 Black Hawk is in service with 35 countries as of 2024.\n\n\n=== Australia ===\n\nAustralia bought early model", "retrieved_t